// # Phys Relativistic -- Astrodynamics, GR, Cosmology, Space Propulsion
//
// Logline: Astrodynamics (Kepler, Lambert, SGP4, attitude, orbit determination), general relativity (Schwarzschild, Kerr, gravitational waves), cosmology (Friedmann, BAO, CMB, dark matter/energy), and space propulsion. Phase 3.4 reorg: merged from phys/astrodynamics/, phys/astrophysics_relativity/, phys/astro_advanced/, phys/space_propulsion/, plus the root relativistic files (gravity_potential_law, hawking_temperature_law, hawking_temperature_strict, pdg_particle_data_group_kat).
//
// Setup: Co-located module of 179 files under std/science/phys/relativistic. Pure compute, no caps.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Astrodynamics family (Kepler, Lambert, SGP4, attitude, orbit determination).
//   2. Space propulsion family (chemical, electric, Hall, ion, nuclear, solar sail, aerocapture).
//   3. General relativity family (Schwarzschild, Kerr, gravitational waves, cosmology).
//   4. Stellar astrophysics family (atmosphere, structure, nucleosynthesis, pulsation).
//   5. Accretion and jets family (Bondi-Hoyle, Shakura-Sunyaev, Blandford-Znajek).

